  "plain": "In 1948, on his family ranch near Aztec, New Mexico, a man named Valentine Archuleta looked up, saw a craft in the sky and watched it hit the mesa, according to his granddaughter. She tells it standing on the land, passing on what he told her: \"he saw it hit right here.\" It is told as an eyewitness account backing the claim that a craft came down near Aztec that year."
